# About Project Zigfall
Zigfall is an MIT-licensed hobby project created by [Emre Güneyler](https://eguneys.github.io).

Zigfall is inspired by [JS13k](https://js13kgames.com/) game jam and [Zig](https://ziglang.org) programming language.

- Source Code: https://github.com/eguneys/zigfall/
- Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/gsoutz